Notebook[{Cell["Couple's time allocation", "Title"], 
  Cell["Explore the model in ../src/Household.wl. The model code lives in \
that package; this notebook only loads it, explores it, and plots. After \
editing the package, rerun the first input cell to reload it.", "Text"], 
  Cell["Load the package", "Section"], Cell["SetDirectory[NotebookDirectory[]\
];\nClearAll[\"Household`*\", \
\"Household`Private`*\"];\nGet[FileNameJoin[{ParentDirectory[], \"src\", \
\"Household.wl\"}]];\n?solveHousehold", "Input"], 
  Cell["One solution", "Section"], Cell["The husband earns w1 = 1 and the \
wife earns w2 = 1.5. Compare the allocation without bias (kappa = 0) and with \
bias (kappa = 2).", "Text"], Cell["Dataset[<|\"kappa = 0\" -> \
solveHousehold[1, 1.5],\n  \"kappa = 2\" -> solveHousehold[1, 1.5, \"Kappa\" \
-> 2]|>]", "Input"], Cell["Relative wages and bias", "Section"], 
  Cell["Move the relative wage w2/w1 and the bias parameter kappa. The bars \
show market hours; the label shows the wife's share of market income.", 
   "Text"], Cell["Manipulate[\n  With[{s = solveHousehold[1, r, \"Kappa\" -> \
k, \"Gamma\" -> g]},\n    BarChart[{s[\"h1\"], s[\"h2\"]},\n      ChartLabels \
-> {\"husband\", \"wife\"}, ChartStyle -> {Blue, Red},\n      PlotRange -> \
{0, 1}, AxesLabel -> {None, \"market hours\"},\n      PlotLabel -> \
StringForm[\"wife's share of income = ``\",\n        \
NumberForm[s[\"WifeShare\"], 3]],\n      ImageSize -> 300]],\n  {{r, 1, \
\"w2/w1\"}, 0.3, 3, Appearance -> \"Labeled\"},\n  {{k, 0, \"kappa (bias)\"}, \
0, 5, Appearance -> \"Labeled\"},\n  {{g, 1, \"gamma (home good)\"}, 0.2, 3, \
Appearance -> \"Labeled\"}]", "Input"], Cell["Market hours against w2/w1", 
   "Section"], Cell["Solid lines: no bias. Dashed lines: kappa = 2. Above \
equal wages the bias keeps the wife's market hours close to the husband's.", 
   "Text"], Cell["ratios = Range[0.4, 2.5, 0.05];\ncurves[k_] := With[{s = \
sweepRelativeWage[ratios, \"Kappa\" -> k]},\n  {Transpose[{ratios, #h1 & /@ \
s}], Transpose[{ratios, #h2 & /@ s}]}];\nListLinePlot[Join[curves[0], \
curves[2]],\n  PlotStyle -> {{Blue}, {Red}, {Blue, Dashed}, {Red, Dashed}},\n \
 PlotLegends -> {\"husband, no bias\", \"wife, no bias\",\n    \"husband, \
kappa = 2\", \"wife, kappa = 2\"},\n  AxesLabel -> {\"w2/w1\", \"market \
hours\"}, GridLines -> {{1}, None},\n  PlotRange -> {0, 1}]", "Input"]}, 
 StyleDefinitions -> "Default.nb"]
